  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Disaster Resilience in Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project will introduce climate change adaptation and disaster risk reduction measures in agriculture. This will take place at different levels, including policy inputs and capacity building activities to staff in the relevant ministerial and local self-government services, incorporation of Climate Smart Agriculture concept in agricultural education and demonstration of best practices in selected municipalities and plots.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
